{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10003_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:691d1dc0fe4d2c42ec6e91e24121a70c6d5bdd32dc47969ecd2151e578a9f389",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617e785fdbabd2d084607f482671d8367594ec5f3d8e75f93318b585131bcca7",
      "text": "圆环指引的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3c1712a52bf53a6d4b2505a9729261c443c92a7586511dcb4f1d73f486388d",
      "text": "看到新晋新锐珠宝设计师制作的\nCafe Parade同人作品，众人兴奋不已。\n以阿斯兰点了一个“赞！”为契机，\n饰品决定正式发售……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617e785fdbabd2d084607f482671d8367594ec5f3d8e75f93318b585131bcca7",
      "text": "圆环指引的前方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ccb65aec10bbcd2b68973e48248630cdc45c44491d76c196b08f0c3a7873ccf",
      "text": "非常感谢您的光临。\n欢迎再次光顾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e75fa17e17621ca465c4d45fdf51cc88a8b3180f876bbff019987d108d6d7182",
      "text": "嗯，那么吾便告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dce7b6bf2e8921abb2b106252d3105e5a9a1dc04627f2ca7eb12522bcaef81d8",
      "text": "库库库……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f98e94c3bbec1e2e55f81c2c1492bd0c5457317cea4d32025a932326745f3b",
      "text": "（在圆桌会议开始前的时间里，\n偶遇踏入的神秘魔石店……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f35ff0e0229ed597500eadd43d1629a5e75b303df063f51467a3f3cfdc0b929",
      "text": "没曾想竟能与如此美妙的圆环\n邂逅……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9a88da1928ad980b9f7d51827043469346ff0b6da6079ce3748c8f75cc0238",
      "text": "今日真是良辰吉日！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f02e639d9e6bde92c9e81f5cf02546410830260358657d87ef6749b2e9db228f",
      "text": "唔？怎么了，撒旦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1047de220979e698b1f52c3b38c24b33932d9b78a70aaec055fb9a5fb562ad3",
      "text": "原来如此。是这圆环与撒旦产生共鸣了吗。\n看来吾之审美眼光并未有差池。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47eed994723d9191e62098a6732f4953e6b772247984fc1ab0fd3258449b964f",
      "text": "速速将此圆环佩戴于身，以增幅吾之力量！\n啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e954a5120cd62d1edb1ddcc4426e468b4ac5d76b71e565fbb566525486f98447",
      "text": "吾之同胞团啊，全员齐聚了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09c3ffe22cfa9424aca3956516561354e238bd6c8fe62ccf65063cd22f9ff3b9",
      "text": "是阿斯兰！呀吼——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e978640b1b615641e2901bb60e937ca79cb068e112bb194ab3005af00fe7ab24",
      "text": "唔？未见主之身影啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc99adbb270b96980c9d8e83fb709f6f41b86b7e63912a1b6cb819ae72002165",
      "text": "听说前面的工作结束了，正在往这边赶。\n刚才来消息说会在约定时间前赶到哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9773ea07eb7db15645fcdb51aa2289a6d04174d28b896f375451af61d05104c7",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生，看起来心情很不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3fd3998e5c2b79ba9778a6913774a284cf9a04aa475dca79e07b06d91f73d97",
      "text": "哎，那个购物袋……\n买了什么东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ef1a52d6a43b3ceea3567c5d526398444dfc6589a7a77223b25548f18e2e9c",
      "text": "库库……吾得到了全新的圆环。\n缠绕着不祥的魔气，与吾极其相衬的极品！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f5b2a1b3f19f5254962405437a99f5bfb727176c0906b5585bca058bddfa4dd",
      "text": "是那么棒的戒指啊。\n买到了好东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a9350de150ebdb8655cc1abbd9399c3fade583e893b572488b21c7abf9e192d",
      "text": "诶——是什么样的？好在意啊～！\n呐，阿斯兰快给我看看嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82ac7862cd14792bc0c9f5acb7eac98be4db8693dd2ed153a27c78cb55a1abe3",
      "text": "且慢。\n待吾开启彼店的电子启示。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ead6007e2d3dd32e303c8bd73f2f98d96a27a4adbde6e9153b5feb60932575",
      "text": "吾之同胞团啊，拭目以待吧！\n此乃吾所入手之圆环！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03d9beb8070022b6f9e82484f43ae28c2ac89318da38988569d57e35b7f39b89",
      "text": "哇，设计好帅气啊♪\n跟阿斯兰好配哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_b:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f7e49d4164b65b6bdcde2787d335edffec41e5ab79fc155424b98599f388cf",
      "text": "……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b49ccc86e4300f50aa32eadfa2c143e30c3ad3f518646692d4dd564d6d900f48",
      "text": "卷绪先生，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed66e7ef44e86f59f0a2f315313c44cf388f0a873caaa7b211b19a0e4da9a90",
      "text": "我搜索了一下阿斯兰先生买的戒指品牌……\n你们看这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa575a62c2bcc448cd2ed4f985cdc20ac29db0de35d8c4d09be55c5f2cda5f54",
      "text": "嗯？这是……负责设计的\n珠宝设计师的社交账号呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c80d5bf74b7267f82d1f0a7b5dd64405a94f6c57b1d1dd807956a8354ae92d2",
      "text": "茶杯造型的胸针，马卡龙造型的耳钉。\n丝带项链和蛋糕造型的耳环……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c788fbbfa61c2e16b8eb1f3de2bc94becf6fb99c4e9f36ed7b85a52fdd80ee",
      "text": "还有打蛋器造型的发夹，\n以及很像撒旦耳饰的戒指！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2273a3ff94be6673ab0dd300a2fbc1d671c042194cfcd64738391a356e57052",
      "text": "每一个都取了名字呢。\n丝带项链是……“Floraison”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c2b46e6b3ca4101b4f495ef008a58bd0ad5fb4f7df444af24fa0b97451c6112",
      "text": "“Floraison”在法语里是\n“盛开”的意思哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f81d393d448ddeb448c4d011b14e3b1fd0c26d9940866e3200038c09abc82f4a",
      "text": "茶杯造型的胸针是“joie”。\n代表“幸福”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0045367a781a2c894fa5008c530bbb5905650c0d40fd99268bb31188836ea3",
      "text": "简直就像是在指水嶋先生和神谷一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998585970713f0093fdaa5e63b5d5ed49b5e4ae88d2fca44fa2eddee48ebd87e",
      "text": "耳钉的“bonbons”是“甜点”，\n耳环的“gâteau”是“蛋糕”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a212a6422c8c00aed2231da0b7f050ecf65d92637a094cc3a0eb372873b22c00",
      "text": "戒指的“Noir de jais”和\n“Génial”，则是“漆黑”与“伟大”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df7916f7380cacaf7ec7e3337760c6c49a10b4854092274f0d48f50899923305",
      "text": "总觉得就像是我们Cafe Parade一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_c:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d698cd7a95104d0975d76001b580d742a171b972a0dfc6329a3b11d1ff8ab16d",
      "text": "……哎呀？这里写着关于饰品的\n概要说明呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199b66edd91b782f56e8f452b5749de9ed229fc715f6f8425d3cb63228b443f3",
      "text": "上面写着“这是以Cafe Parade那般\n个性洋溢的光芒为灵感创作的同人作品”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:891478c3749a968fa99f341084eb8d65f3444e539fb9395387d3b9774e221d6f",
      "text": "啊！这位设计师，\n我之前就觉得名字好像在哪里见过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317b8fee26a811d0d48b60860027e6a4616b111f45d02c3a5d2516bdc875a74f",
      "text": "最近在社交平台上超级有话题度哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e06265980dc9b5d619eb200481fc51399db8c793f8fa65bd3965af92dcefa61",
      "text": "是新晋新锐的珠宝艺术家吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d0455f5212d4251edb7beeaa84dc90c85c82815f5cf3f96905c92a16698a02",
      "text": "能为我们制作同人作品，真开心啊。\n真想向对方传达感谢的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d82a5d94ad80e60a51d15a33b93f95f6928720f25e09b4bd1dc6720a74e1ab",
      "text": "但是，如果突然收到本人发来的评论，\n对方会不会吓一跳呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fc0a6d8623455ec720b97f9b0e7387124722d27218a7735c69db0ceb4643fac",
      "text": "……既然如此，至少留下感谢的刻印吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52bd743070129038203d8172fb452c5931780a42983e4354044aed41c5dee8eb",
      "text": "原来如此，是点一个“赞！”啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81d038e53d4764fd45604334a8974286dfda494d5ee9ff79eed5d572f6bb023",
      "text": "呵呵，要是能被设计师注意到\n那就太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2fbb1a02889ca49aa7b06568f055b3fa95c139a4c0b8a663c4ad6b64d4b865",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。\n大家都在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646f1b991276553482d6df4b3668484e549173691fd260961bffd0baa9ffd3ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ed5c023e5bc35e6c7451e18950d7c60fdb5fbd7ed01180e3cb83389e108487",
      "text": "呐呐快听我说！\n刚才发生了一件超级厉害的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000171:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000179:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf02505a7a8f97b6920af0788d05047339204e996606ebba3bcd374ff016f1fc",
      "text": "是主吗？\n方才未能接听实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:864983dc0bb4fef986f6a5c72cdd2b58e15d3a25db62d4c35361f9299ab8c2fd",
      "text": "吾方才正精炼暗之供物。\n话说回来，吾主唤吾何事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000183:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:926d2e6aa3723fe03ddca4482db3af47f93a012b8dffb97fff5c9dc8408d6531",
      "text": "珠宝设计师\n发来了委托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5378d29aaabf24c457f4959feef0ecaea83fb23220108513cd9b51aae9c279c3",
      "text": "此、此话当真！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efbaf606133624a0d625cb830cefa08639f1a68b0e11e4c505fcc1382cefd20",
      "text": "竟能与精炼彼圆环之人共担试炼……！\n吾之灵魂已兴奋得颤抖不已！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0375251cea030c1692f7b7e458a6e8edd2432597e9ec2eba3abdc87b929e1bf",
      "text": "详情明天在事务所\n当面跟您说吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2a60997bf2e009c26722fecf10de48a08b2d6e6483808d64702083c7e9105a1",
      "text": "吾已知晓。神谷亦在此处。\n由吾转告彼即可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f4f71ce76e4b590af16f24fd58b7eebbf09392318fd8c513c006edb3af24f3",
      "text": "库库，神谷亦必当欢欣雀跃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c3c06cc70422c3fe27dbe396b9eb62e9944a7b512dfdd2118e8499e6a966fb0",
      "text": "吾主啊，吾静候明日之详谈！\n啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3fd48d8a14e28115ce2d60b136574bf462a5fe036d0e8ddd0937ac808e8eeff",
      "text": "制作人！我听阿斯兰和神谷说了～！\n听说那个饰品，要正式发售了对不对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2e42bd755f13f92ec7aca87cb6e372316b0a9b1230da949929c0892d322372",
      "text": "是的。以大家为灵感创作的那个\n同人作品，已经决定商品化了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e7d2c510f85a5789d4c71d55c9a1c6f053e3a12023d37920ddcbe6903c0d6d",
      "text": "将作为12月的圣诞礼物进行发售。而且\n令人惊讶的是，对方还邀请大家出演CM！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:595ac1c4cb0d580b2501ecbb7f4f418d691b536a3dbe0be2a3877d28806b9e94",
      "text": "据说是看到阿斯兰先生点的“赞！”之后\n联系我们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ccea7409520c2e83dec57883aa4a154d6a79c253183b79fd7278e2fbd68230",
      "text": "不仅为我们制作了珠宝饰品，\n甚至连CM都交给我们出演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd20b8d6741ae8b97eb054966f92f602f61ea650d57237d6c20d076089840586",
      "text": "这都多亏了阿斯兰先生点的那记“赞！”呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d10616922c1a2055d27202ecd854474786ff0faed5f9c54d7f90148e3bf1ca5f",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢你，阿斯兰。\n人家超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4f16349ab50996c4ec5e0942dc3f824cfa649994fb1fa35f292d1756054a77",
      "text": "无、无须多礼。吾从一开始\n便预见到了此番未来。啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108bc9cbe60da0b1d03435ea171f7fbf11ed0c3d888c4b76f725b14b5c8c337",
      "text": "Gift除了礼物的含义之外，也有才能\n和特别的力量的意思在里面哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb41d1d0ba9b2a624a0fd2a5be8d4600327de488ee116e5580fbfaf01bf09821",
      "text": "啊啊。如果作为Cafe Parade的我们拥有\n特别的力量的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6d1c35e27cd408e3e3ddcc652d48bd2b7607eda43c2dfcf0b3224f156a6e49a",
      "text": "那么我希望通过这些珠宝饰品，\n将那股力量传递给全世界的大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8168d5b3e8157eb8f85cbc7fdb99d5ff6798cc6577eec4bd9b7d4099cb425e8",
      "text": "希望能无论何时都陪伴在身旁，照亮并点亮\n大家的人生呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee306a56635ccf5b7d73e5afc922a17eb415863f111c93a6bc3374cefb6689ae",
      "text": "好的！大家一起传递给所有人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000170:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcc0b26cbb5f105d5df1e6aa4c39fa70022707efeb80a8c866bfe0ea03e71cb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n珠宝的样品\n收到了哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c23f5fd35b0b44e51ff6efb06e498d1086d8767c11e318b73f42be1298bf7c",
      "text": "谢谢你\n帮我们拜托对方～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa8edfa0cf9415cb799faf03dadf4285e2a700cb172d1647ec1f86bcbbfbbe5f",
      "text": "照片虽然也很棒，\n但实物还要更——加\n超级可爱呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c2c096541598ac9a151dff3d98f72649a68240312be98977b5a3714fe50d0e",
      "text": "明明这么小巧，\n做工却如此精巧啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29377eb48526c09f279deda6489a1e30ed336cedb898287731a9f401c01e5816",
      "text": "原来如此，真是受益匪浅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd77a037571e5b0116d33c36507535f5e4aa20e6a8302be74398254164b9554",
      "text": "一想到这是对方心中想着我们\n制作出来的东西，\n喜悦就更深了一层呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d972dc588c9ff6eabc3d3214c6c3df1c370e616ceaaf4e08f516b7b865f88618",
      "text": "对方也很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000189:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a05cc56b00a7d919f3a009f1d6797e1c0d8745e3412390973d5f0e3115581fc",
      "text": "各位能答应下来，\n对方也非常高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be534aa8b3c1788bf2447b43e03ed2cda01f2929b4aa9dc628cd13b1ce7f8cef",
      "text": "每一件都很棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000190:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe58688765367cb6a54c368ef2a70673928fcecd64d582e779decdafe265beb",
      "text": "每一件都很棒呢！\n听说对方也很期待成品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000194:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28c7a4488ad168b01d55878b5df85397a1c8d62c066e655185cca124cf23bf5d",
      "text": "能得到这样的评价，真是深感光荣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000196:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12351ce197e1a30e344654f6e0b0f7c66616e3b2a77312026c68d6cb81e9f7f2",
      "text": "说起来撒旦也\n收到了饰品\n对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000198:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4386286ab66feab3d869e5758e39660be8c2642fdea0c52e59f83682e574bbc6",
      "text": "好想知道是什么感觉啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000200:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6538f687d5d2e9f325576143b5ab4e8eedf85fe1f505dbeb11aece502f40e27b",
      "text": "吾已知晓。\n稍后便将残影传送与汝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7afe54921eef6c482d3ec8b5eaae6180556ac640a47e20e097ac3a0eb59e782",
      "text": "训练超级圆满地结束啦，辛苦了！\n刚才好帅气哦，卷卷☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20b74e233c62eb79dca328a75d77aae1141552af660851244b81ce9770cb333",
      "text": "啊哈哈，谢谢。\n咲酱也是状态越来越好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae838f7343b5783f2ff61269729ff9021cca93b4cab55fc7c078b2d7132b4a6a",
      "text": "特别是最后那一幕……啊！\n说起来台本……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd81567d5d52fb9f06c05f48ee6881ff56a6094f4656d39e8ebe58863c638d0",
      "text": "怎么了吗，卷卷？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a203022138327b83e91a1161fe1efdbd7e9903e5b50bf62ba67592ab77ef2599",
      "text": "果然不在。台本好像落在练习室了。\n我回去拿一下。咲酱你先回去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68840556a312a2046f36841297e79965908fb26f7ae182d349458f3da79e11e",
      "text": "嗯，知道了！明天见咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000084:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a6d9f8ac93d41ae46200f74e5fa66c8b2d2bdf74ae48965c0c9a843d109700",
      "text": "休息区",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b656f5613feb8766b032f45540308be5539de9eda8728f208086effe3f4d8583",
      "text": "那个，刚才用的练习室是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35592de3c49ddd852beab1f75388dbc00f9160610cee0aa8a2e7bc637cc56799",
      "text": "咦，灯还亮着？\n有人在里面吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf97a67f098c83d333df5c6e5ecbf9d6cbb021d0494145301268911b54515242",
      "text": "“对吾而言，乃不可或缺之物”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eb8c06492210dce6bb5cb28d546c5b1193663c40c988c2de551886920771508",
      "text": "唔……仅凭现在的程度，还不足以动摇灵魂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5ff118fafa576151ca6836d6b116762bcd5fdc1b31d08a2f07a819e15aeaa4e",
      "text": "……撒旦你也这样认为吗。\n既然如此，稍作歇息后，便再次演绎一番吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9083a05f323e037f5aadb2e86433a53d8cc2ce24c89f5c7c5b52d10d314c8ab",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a21bd20e311b57f4ae1470b15e77196972def1965581938085860de56fac1cd",
      "text": "辛苦了，阿斯兰先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5468a97cc7565cdee357d56eacc3178b64af10df4f4dcb95cdf0815f20105f7",
      "text": "卷绪！？\n汝不是应当已与咲一同归还了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e1b93c1e5eb6519e35d5e54f60bf24258393cacd6ad6a7da48aec87b2b5dd9",
      "text": "我落了东西，回来拿的。\n阿斯兰先生这么晚了还在练习吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2411660303916127cadb55782b05b8bf4cc27cc83b554ead325455763cdb8956",
      "text": "唔、嗯……神谷之前不是说过了吗？\n想要通过神秘的魔石，将特殊力量传递给全世界。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcbe2c75444ad583a13f2649dc5ff04397e5a7ec696ed0f98e70e830ce23d28a",
      "text": "吾与撒旦邂逅，被赋予了黑暗之力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dab67f461ac3e87b7a6631f1312713bbf2eb649399d2416066fa5910ac76c7",
      "text": "吾亦欲如同撒旦一般通过此圆环，\n为迷途羔羊赐予黑暗之力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35a39c142edbc10ceac77f12f0152525fcf03b53c88f7854a373d5e881cf313b",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdf0f6c98b063fcd0face22460541fec77ad791619ed51661c159df0d1abfa99",
      "text": "不介意的话可以一起练习吗？\n如果有什么我能帮上忙的，请尽管告诉我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec46c46e51cbb6be04c242d61975b68e5bce2d4ea0c8d9344b8734fc1d601e3",
      "text": "卷绪啊，吾向汝致谢。\n为了彼之试炼，一同反复磨砺吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fc23db9741784c94e34e3cf7b5bcf4f2da5e13d6db1ac1fae9bd0fd78c6718",
      "text": "CM拍摄",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a096822090485f0dd755074c370ad8f818a917306f4707d3a2dd2994238cd913",
      "text": "“……嗯，果然不出我所料。\n那副耳环，非常适合你哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb0bdd0b5f999338dc1473073937163c8d40d815456e1225a13f77945042955",
      "text": "“这条项链，超级可爱的对吧！\n人家一见钟情了呢♪”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9ff11c58b644a90787e99f5041f0eb70eacdb29b8b7fdd0bc398b5d93c872d",
      "text": "“我是想着你才挑选的。\n愿意收下它吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc173a17acc9858dc1c9c5e270d0ae0f76ec26b42e164141b0ad5cf65212afea",
      "text": "“珠宝饰品真是奇妙呢。\n光是佩戴在身上，心情就会变得明朗起来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41cd8b7f8682cc7e2e67a15f690cb93fafb750b7f598af6037a750a160962637",
      "text": "“从吾之恩人处承蒙赐予的，漆黑宝石……\n对吾而言，乃不可或缺之物”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2ad0dae873faf44f08bb64b8981989103aaebc4f12db3e506fd73ad650aab8",
      "text": "“戴上珠宝，世界便熠熠生辉”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86228ce046efb1331eea823805c4ed5531c0cf5e34e195b3844d055670eeba1",
      "text": "“只属于你的珠宝，就在这里。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e365c2e18e3a90b52b8500406c562c4958d6db3c339cffb3bc19ecb914e58b",
      "text": "“无论何时，都将这份点亮人生的\n最棒的礼物，赠予你”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0830213395790ab6ea0d21990855f41c1352323dbe801092f1c9dc7c7d1c995",
      "text": "（通过了……！导演和设计师\n都非常满意地点头了呢！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706a6de3060934c8220c81979f3f81ca870c0a9121afbb2176e726f8de6d480e",
      "text": "（吾之灵魂正在震颤。\n感受到了魔力的高涨……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08c46249358464f5e8d6ea78cec1bd3a0a43af2cab9709dd3433431cd8ef2076",
      "text": "迷途羔羊啊，戴上这漆黑的光芒吧！\n若如此，吾便赐予汝黑暗之力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:119765bfd565894dca31ccc6e3a2d4c9caeafdb21df286c10628234192b8d3da",
      "text": "刚才那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ebe794e34af659cafb5711ebfbbaaddb41a2edd71caace1e655ce4c3d2ed949",
      "text": "（哈！？糟、糟糕了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:541c9dd875ef75d99fb8667be670c2c9dcc713b95a5bd99fc4aef7295c36c583",
      "text": "那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a53d65768dc5d1cd53279ec01550e396c481ec0ebb938d043bd776e5b307dc2c",
      "text": "如果有感到悲伤或寂寞的人，\n希望能通过这枚戒指赋予他们力量与勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66da5b226e164e2ac9f85f56641672c3d08b41f40888323c6583156fd1b7ab0",
      "text": "……他是这个意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414e2ffe172520ad7a18be99a83c77daa60138fb07d7ac1dd8b7cdea0dac3736",
      "text": "原来如此！这不是挺好的嘛！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b425392ca9b8681b1bf8d557db6e915287d2de441107a0bcbd4ed1ad777fafe2",
      "text": "是的！非常棒呢。\n请务必把刚才这句台词也采用进去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502949ebdbde5dd5ffce65a3122638c9586bba07e3e8c990d092052e38d0af26",
      "text": "太厉害了！太好了呢，阿斯兰♪\n人家也被刚才那句台词深深打动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b0d553674581fc57543a2bfbe943261defee2e46df84cee057c52c952186093",
      "text": "是的。而且，我们心中所蕴含的想法\n也与阿斯兰先生是一样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a1f0507e08afb632ec6679b73d407ad3830bb73429c7931a36aa786c32460d",
      "text": "啊啊。谢谢你带来了这么美妙的台词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2726796b8edfd61c7b755cd4d1680e3af64133340758dc6705ab0dd09e780794",
      "text": "真不愧是阿斯兰先生！\n真期待CM的成片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18bcf117ecd5b43e4fc333e3d76bfda5c8af7567e90fd321281c138debd7a281",
      "text": "！是吗……\n向汝致谢，卷绪。多亏了汝啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_i:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007111bacd495c5e52ca5a2cc83635f1eeed236f5319cd5545e182c715ce198c",
      "text": "不用客气，阿斯兰先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076e81c5f9e1bc555babfd8d315221cee4991b5d11914c38b5454bc81cdbeb3d",
      "text": "Cafe Parade店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54351d52e17d4bf35b3051cb64569213017056a61079ce5f46004b05e06f2937",
      "text": "各位，饮品都已经倒好了呢。\n那么神谷，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f19366df01b78f47148b13503c32205d568b61b9ef807b7818496d5b3107b245",
      "text": "啊啊。今年也发生了很多事呢。\n能像这样和大家一起度过年末，我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a4a481261acee2fe4d8332ba2dd032e0d9bc2d2b4b238af920a53e8e3d80cd",
      "text": "珠宝的CM也顺利播出了，\n今天就痛痛快快地庆祝一番吧。干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:678d5bcc12c76733f7e51260f0f068403fd239155952cdb38fb1491e9f6694d5",
      "text": "呐呐，看社交平台了吗？\n我们的CM反响超级好的哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45626e7c46c38402d3d8fc7e000ded8840d8a5bcbed615110209f2db870fd0e4",
      "text": "也有人晒出了珠宝的照片呢。\n还有人写了“非常喜欢”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea544768e1a70048a98a6128f2b30c11297d283f9c5975d18cb1543cfce1a03",
      "text": "听说还有人是因为阿斯兰先生的台词，\n才下定决心购买的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbc00a4baa991e3a09a7148d4f1be6a24dd670d115ad7e3086410ab7afa4b338",
      "text": "此、此话当真？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4333cc8c62ee2b6efddd9a792b2a735470f31c861c7ef8b4c2704c43a6f2e8c6",
      "text": "阿斯兰的……大家的心意，\n都切实地传达给每个人了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_j:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75de1c29d5d9ed5e0f8dae07d43a3cce339d05c6ce8758dff52840b06de4169d",
      "text": "明年开始也为了给更多的人带去幸福，\n一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf1552b03f4ac6d055b1958670a08b2b2bb699e882991f24153178438625d95f",
      "text": "超级开心的～！\n还和大家一起看了CM♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3cc2bb7bccee9ffb21542bc56c68f5a43a76d4f6d16a989f8159d703b173ac2",
      "text": "嗯。畅谈追忆之时，\n竟是如此令人愉悦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff0d906715caebb88f9f13a07dbe9f1b86851fbb3007a20e3bfc748bcbf3c6cd",
      "text": "不知不觉聊得太投入，\n回去的时间稍微变晚了点呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a2c205561cbf13a453df4398334f247ebd59dcedfdd23775b4530d4e3b307f",
      "text": "各位在回家的路上请多加小心。\n特别是神谷，可千万别迷路了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f373a7eb8371a06c0bcb274df3fc323dfc68dc63e576d1364bc6aeb2cbcb2a7",
      "text": "哈哈，东云真是瞎操心啊。\n没事的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c492fc0e799c1ef85efdf5a78e98d8974d31dd0b577bcb99358500299d57172c",
      "text": "那么大家，再见咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000112:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48463b36e2734c9c53dcdcd7acb97e01bac095c311080e61a527ef3c8c1c874c",
      "text": "阿斯兰的卧室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8599d1b428e61d8e14eaa618b45f4980750b37592f4009188a4369afc3f057a1",
      "text": "撒旦啊……吾是否也像撒旦一样，\n稍许为光之民赐予了力量呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc6df7e420ea3553057906b1495dd8c8971c4a1d64cf2be4a5075be913079835",
      "text": "（与同胞团共度的时光赐予了吾安宁……\n今后亦当集结魔力，共行霸道）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af84f800e2d617fbeb323f37646aa8799f14bd721cc249775eff8162089c24d8",
      "text": "……差不多该就寝了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd20b8d6741ae8b97eb054966f92f602f61ea650d57237d6c20d076089840586",
      "text": "这都多亏了阿斯兰先生点的那记“赞！”呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:287dd353ef12a9f48426c06eaba4dd0348414199bfb3ec0b03fa376a462e9ca9",
      "text": "（是吗，吾也……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_k:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164c5cb184dec869f2398e2859fe9956053179a2056042e337c91d5f49dab94d",
      "text": "呵呵……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
